flowchart TD
    U[Authenticated caller] --> S[Spring Security]
    S --> C[Financial controller]
    C --> A[Financial application service]

    A --> R{Role allowed for operation?}
    R -->|No| F[FINANCIAL_OPERATION_NOT_ALLOWED 403]
    R -->|Yes| Q{Select trusted lookup}

    Q -->|Administrator read| G[Global settlement lookup]
    Q -->|Startup read| SU[Lookup by settlement and startup]
    Q -->|Investor read or pay| IN[Lookup by settlement and investor]

    G --> X{Settlement found?}
    SU --> X
    IN --> X
    X -->|No| N[SETTLEMENT_NOT_FOUND 404]
    X -->|Yes| O[Evaluate state after authority]

    O -->|Initially not payable| P[SETTLEMENT_NOT_PAYABLE 409]
    O -->|Allowed| B[Execute financial use case]

    F --> H[Shared RFC 9457 adapter]
    N --> H
    P --> H
    H --> D[Allowlisted Problem Details]
